{
  "id": 2069,
  "name": "battle-tablecloth",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ビビッドなカラーが　目を引く　一品。これを　敷いて　食事を　すれば人もポケモンも　やる気が　みなぎる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "비비드한 컬러가 눈길을 사로잡는 테이블보. 이것을 깔고 식사하면 사람도 포켓몬도 의욕이 샘솟는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鮮明的色彩抓得住眾人的目光。鋪設這種桌巾後再用餐，不論是人還是寶可夢都會充滿幹勁。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe aux couleurs éclatantes qui attire le regard. N’importe quel humain ou Pokémon mangeant sur cette nappe se sentira prêt à tout entreprendre.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mit seinen lebhaften Farben zieht dieses Tischtuch alle Blicke auf sich. Wirft man es über den Esstisch, sprudeln Mensch und Pokémon nur so über vor Tatendrang!",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este mantel cuenta con un diseño y unos colores muy llamativos que llenan de energía y vitalidad tanto a personas como a Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia appariscente dai colori sgargianti. Una tavola apparecchiata con questa tovaglia dà la carica sia ai Pokémon che alle persone.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A garish, eye-catching tablecloth. Putting this on your picnic table will inspire any person or Pokémon who eats there to do their best.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ビビッドなカラーが　目を引く　一品。これを　敷いて　食事を　すれば人もポケモンも　やる気が　みなぎる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "颜色鲜艳引人注目的桌巾。只要铺上这个吃饭，无论是人还是宝可梦都会充满干劲。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
